                                                "sense_id": "e22f2456-6739-3979-835a-c599f07019a4",
                                                "text": "“As an inventor,” Bob Mason suggested, “you're a howling success at shooting craps ! If I were as free of spavins, ringbone, saddle-galls, and splints as you are, I'd have that nanny-goat in here, hog-tie her, flop her and let the boy help himself. […]”"
                                            }
